   "text": "University of Westminster – Foundation - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nUniversity of Westminster – Foundation\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nWestminster has its main campus in Regent Street, right in the heart of central London, with additional campuses in Fitzrovia, Marylebone and Harrow. The university has numerous centers of research excellence. It is ranked #701-750 in QS Global World Rankings 2022.There are many options for studying an undergraduate or postgraduate pathway course at Kaplan International College (KIC) London, and students can progress to University of Westminster.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n08/06/2026 10:46\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n22/04/2026 06:07\nby Eston Dalmeida\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nYearly Fees\nMax: £19,928.00\nMin: £17,799.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n49%\n9,310 of 19,000 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nKaplan\nFounded Year\n1838\nCampus(es)\nLondon\nCountry\nUnited Kingdom\nExcluded Countries\nBelarus, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Russia, Syria, Ukraine, United States, Pakistan\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n30/09/2025\nContract End Date\n01/01/2070\nContract Entity\nQSSA Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-qsyY9_1SXU\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
